        },
        {
            "title": "Ponglow Super Theme update",
            "date": "2019-06-20 09:33:33",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/2415533798131850124",
            "content": "Todays update brings the super hero theme, minor changes and fixes to gameplay and finally new sound tracks to replace old ones"
        },
        {
            "title": "New Themes Update",
            "date": "2019-06-17 21:15:36",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/2408777766653624655",
            "content": "To days update brings 2 new themes, The Egyptian theme and trippy theme. Also all original modes have had art updates and more. Some bugs with the ball are fixed. If you come across any bugs please let us know in the forums.\r\n\r\nThanks"
        },
        {
            "title": "Ponglow Update 6/14/2019",
            "date": "2019-06-14 14:22:53",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/2408777766641748554",
            "content": "Updated\r\n\r\n- Updated the chance of different themes loading. You will now get other themes loading almost all the time rather then the 666 in 1 chance.\r\n- Added more special blocks for those who get past level 10\r\n- Added 3 new tunes made by Kash production\r\n- Move the end game dev block to level 30+\r\n\r\n\r\nThings to come \r\n\r\n-Graphic Updates\r\n-2 player\r\n-Level editor\r\n\r\n\r\nCheers!"
        },
        {
            "title": "PonGlow is Live",
            "date": "2019-06-10 12:26:02",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/2411028931154799518",
            "content": "Massive appreciation to all the beta testers and the forthought that has gone into Ponglow. Thank you for all the support.\r\n\r\nThe development of Ponglow is still ongoing and you can expect many more new updates like\r\n\r\n-New modes!\r\n-Multiplayer!\r\n-Level Editor!\r\n-More Unique Blocks!\r\n-Achievements! \r\n\r\nAs time elapses Ponglow will establish new, more extensive activity. More and more content will be included! We are truly humbled and grateful for all the enthusiasm surrounding the project and it's development"
        }
    ]
